            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080304.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "美",
          "content": "<p>国内华达天文台，推出“<a href=\"https://www.sierra-remote.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">望远镜托管</a>“服务。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080301.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>天文爱好者可以将自己的望远镜，托管在天文台的沙漠基地，观察条件远胜于城市，通过网络查看望远镜传回的影像。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080302.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>天文台直接出售望远镜时间，是不是更有吸引力？我买下一小时的使用权，就可以网上操作真正的天文望远镜。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "望远镜托管",
              "url": "https://www.sierra-remote.com/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080301.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080302.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "国际空间站",
          "content": "<p>庆祝运作25周年。人类已经在这个小小的太空舱，连续居住了25年。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025073101.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
