          "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2024/08/weekly-issue-313.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">如果新加坡没有空调</a>（#313）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2023/07/weekly-issue-263.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">开源软件如何赚钱？</a>（#263）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2022/07/weekly-issue-213.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">知识孤岛，知识软件</a>（#213）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2021/06/weekly-issue-163.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你的城市有多少张病床？</a>（#163）</p>",
